sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Shopper
    participant UI as React Checkout
    participant API as Express API
    participant Auth as Auth/RBAC
    participant Atlas as MongoDB Atlas
    participant Products as products
    participant Orders as orders

    Shopper->>UI: Confirm checkout
    UI->>API: POST /api/orders/checkout + Idempotency-Key
    API->>Auth: Authenticate shopper and load current role
    Auth->>Atlas: Read users by token subject
    Atlas-->>Auth: Current shopper principal
    Auth-->>API: Authorized principal
    API->>API: Validate Zod body; aggregate duplicate product IDs
    API->>API: Recompute landed-cost quote server-side
    API->>Orders: Find existing order by unique idempotencyKey
    alt Matching prior request
        Orders-->>API: Original order
        API-->>UI: 200 original order (no stock update)
    else New request
        API->>Atlas: Start multi-document transaction
        loop Each distinct product
            API->>Products: Read product and ensure stock >= requested quantity
            Products-->>API: Current product/price/stock
            API->>Products: Conditional stock decrement
            Products-->>API: Updated stock count
        end
        API->>Orders: Insert order with items/quote/escrow state held
        Orders-->>API: Insert acknowledged
        API->>Atlas: Commit transaction
        Atlas-->>API: Commit acknowledged
        API-->>UI: 201 created order; simulated escrow held
    end
    alt Insufficient stock or any write fails
        API->>Atlas: Abort transaction
        Atlas-->>API: Rollback stock changes and order insert
        API-->>UI: 409 STOCK_INSUFFICIENT / transaction error
    end
